Review `testdata/ocr-acceptance/<runId>/acceptance-report.json` and the per-stage logs. The new acceptance launcher has 12 stages. Require all 12 to pass, all five-image batches and both order tests to be exact, the negative-control baseline to pass before the one-field wrong-expected run, and the lifecycle-only Asashio test to prove timeout, termination, close, and successful fresh-child output. Keep the separate reported-screen recovery exact-match stage failed until damage and all other fields match.

